WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
You said you want to be humble and move towards the mouse

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,720
They dug high and big

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,600
They'll regret it. Leave them alone.

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,360
Our house burned all night last night

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,800
The coin's ice shell should be reinforced. I'll check it again.

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,370
There will be heavier snow tonight

7
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:27,010
The snow tonight will be heavier than yesterday. Bring your viewing tools with me to the top of the mountain. Brother Meng Chuan.

8
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,370
Our house is halfway up the mountain

9
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:30,770
Why go to the top of the mountain and make something to keep out the snow?

10
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,370
Uncle Zhou Xuan, you stay and watch the fire. Uncle, watch.

11
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,090
It's so windy up here

12
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:47,940
How do you do these bombs? Why do you put these lumber along this line?

13
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,260
Poke one by one into the snow

14
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,060
Insert it deeper, insert the old blood

15
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,100
Send a bomb
